<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#16263F',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: '100%', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 3, marginBottom: 14 }}>CHAPTER 02 · LEARNING ROADMAP</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 40 }}>学习路线：四阶段爬坡</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 0 }}>
      {[
        { n: '01', t: '前置', d: '角色定位 + 术语扫盲', l: '第 1-2 讲' },
        { n: '02', t: '入门', d: '会调用 · 会提问 · 会用框架', l: '第 3-5 讲' },
        { n: '03', t: '进阶', d: '开源模型 · 本地部署 · 安全', l: '第 6-8 讲' },
        { n: '04', t: '高级', d: 'RAG · Agent · 多模态', l: '第 9-10 讲' },
      ].map((item, idx) => (
        <Box key={idx} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', flex: 1 }}>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.06)', border: '1px solid rgba(220,231,245,0.15)', borderRadius: 12, padding: '26px 22px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 10 }}>{item.n}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 12 }}>{item.t}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.7, marginBottom: 10 }}>{item.d}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8FA4B8' }}>{item.l}</Text>
          </Box>
          {idx < 3 && (
            <Box style={{ width: 40, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
              <FAIcon name='chevron-right' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
            </Box>
          )}
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 36, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
      <FAIcon name='lightbulb' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 20, height: 20 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#DCE7F5' }}>
        每爬一级，能力半径扩大一圈——先会用，再会调，最后会造
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, right: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA4B8' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 0 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA4B8' }}>03 / 11</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
